  "id": 227,
  "title": "智慧园区已成为社区管理的一种新理念",
  "date": "2023-05-19",
  "summary": "智慧园区是指充分利用物联网、云计算、移动互联网等新一代信息技术的集成应用，为社区居民提供一个安全、舒适、便利的现代化、智慧化生活环境。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-227.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-19/20235191746315251.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-19/20235191746573465.png\" title=\"1\" alt=\"1\" /><br /><br /></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\">园区</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">是社区管理的一种新理念，是新形势下社会管理创新的一种新模式。</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">是指充分利用物联网、云计算、移动互联网等新一代信息技术的集成应用，为社区居民提供一个安全、舒适、便利的现代化、智慧化生活环境，从而形成基于信息化、智能化社会管理与服务的一种新的管理形态的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">智慧</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">建设能够有效推动经济转型，促进现代服务业发展。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">依托自主研发的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">开河</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">平台</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，结合智慧社区运营管理模式，将社区内各子系统进行整合，利用三维可视化优势，助力社区以</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一张图</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">实现智慧</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">可视化管理，有效避免以往小区因</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孤岛式</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">管理而导致成本高、效率低等问题。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">基于</span> Web 3D <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">开发技术搭建的虚拟智慧</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">，将</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">内的建筑、道路、绿化等各种设施设备按照</span> 1<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">1 </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">建模还原。通过</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云“开河”平台</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">，并结合物理渲染材质系统，渲染出真实的小区环境效果。</span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">围绕社区场景进行自动漫游展示，让用户仿佛置身于社区场景之中。分别搭建白天与夜晚两套场景，白天场景整体设计以写实风格为主基调，夜晚场景更偏向于具有科幻感。除了通过手动交互进行切换外，亦可对接真实时间来做到白天与夜晚场景自动切换，满足实际使用场景。</span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">同样支持导入</span> IFC <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">格式的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"> BIM </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">模型文件生成场景，或渲染</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"> 3D Tiles </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">格式的倾斜摄影模型文件。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">通过借助</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">开河</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">平台</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">赋能，对各子系统的数据进行整合，将社区的基本信息、物业人员、停车场、设备设施等主要信息结合社区三维场景进行展示。通过交互可将三维场景视角聚焦到所选小区，同时概览数据细化至</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">单体建筑</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">级别，方便用户</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">掌握</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">整体社区概况。</span></span></p><p><br /></p>",
  "click": 89100,
